A few important html tags for beginners:-
<br>
| Tag        | Purpose                          |
| ---------- | -------------------------------- |
| `<html>`   | Defines the HTML document        |
| `<head>`   | Contains page information        |
| `<title>`  | Sets the browser tab title       |
| `<body>`   | Contains visible webpage content |
| `<h1>`     | Main heading                     |
| `<p>`      | Paragraph                        |
| `<a>`      | Creates a link                   |
| `<img>`    | Adds an image                    |
| `<ul>`     | Unordered list                   |
| `<ol>`     | Ordered list                     |
| `<li>`     | List item                        |
| `<table>`  | Creates a table                  |
| `<form>`   | Creates a form                   |
| `<input>`  | Creates an input field           |
| `<button>` | Creates a button                 |
| `<div>`    | Groups content                   |
